    "text": "Corpus Christi\nCCISD students celebrate library makeover at Kolda Elementary\n53 minutes ago\nCORPUS CHRISTI, Texas — Students and staff at Zachary Kolda Elementary got their first look this evening at the school’s newly remodeled library. Thanks to grant funding, Kolda is one of 24 Corpus Christi ISD campuses receiving a full library refresh. The upgrades include murals, themed reading spaces and thousands of dollars in new books.",
